ishtaria-datadisk-tutorial (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Teach the story-disk features the Gilgamesh disk introduced, on a procedural world:
    a measured site, a surveyed cairn, a landscape patch, a walkable structure,
    a wildlife overlay, a patrol, wanderers who share a greeting, a taller body,
    and cover and ambient music.
  * Leave the planet procedural and the character choice free, so this disk can
    share a world with one that defines a real planet.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <cybervitexus@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0200

ishtaria-datadisk-tutorial (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of the Tutorial World datadisk.
  * Demonstrates all implemented Ishtaria features:
    - Movement and UI basics
    - Gathering and crafting
    - Combat and hunting
    - Building and placement
    - Trading and economy
    - Magic system
    - Federation and portals
  * Includes 8 tutorial zones with specialized NPC tutors
  * English and Czech localization

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <cybervitexus@gmail.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0200
